 that concealment makes the union's safety and mass rules meaningless.","external_conflict":"Nera's power readings, Ivo's roster records, and Sela's audit authority threaten to expose the unlogged hull and the consortium's effort to extend heat-roster limits.","arc":"Dax begins convinced that the hidden reserve and longer shifts are practical compromises that no one needs to know about. When Nera's witnessed power test makes the live hull impossible to dismiss, he must choose whether to destroy the remaining confidence in the ledger by denying what the records show. He instead identifies the hull as an intentional reserve in his audit statement, ending with a public admission of the concealment but still facing the consequences of having treated safety limits as negotiable.","personality_traits":["calculating","composed","pragmatic","controlling"],"abilities":[{"name":"Operational planning","description":"Can allocate yard resources and estimate the production effects of competing schedules.","category":"mental"},{"name":"Institutional persuasion","description":"Can frame operational decisions in terms likely to appeal to consortium leadership.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_nera_ivo","source_character_id":"chr_nera_voss","target_character_id":"chr_ivo_renn","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Nera Voss depends on Ivo Renn's access to union rosters to corroborate her hull readings, while Ivo's demand for careful procedure frustrates her urgency."},{"id":"rel_ivo_dax","source_character_id":"chr_ivo_renn","target_character_id":"chr_dax_orrin","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Ivo Renn opposes Dax Orrin's push for longer sunside shifts, seeing it as a direct threat to the charter that the union is tasked with enforcing."},{"id":"rel_nera_sela","source_character_id":"chr_nera_voss","target_character_id":"chr_sela_morin","relationship_type":"uneasy_ally","description":"Nera Voss needs Sela Morin to make the live power draw count as audit evidence, while Sela's insistence on verification makes Nera fear the deadline will pass."},{"id":"rel_sela_dax","source_character_id":"chr_sela_morin","target_character_id":"chr_dax_orrin","relationship_type":"adversary","description":"Sela Morin's audit authority threatens Dax Orrin's effort to keep the reserve hull and its power draw off the mass ledger."}]}
